    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1ab619f52c034291ab79aa09a23b505c",
      "statement": "Long-lived multiplexed HTTP/2 connections make naive connection-level load balancing a poor fit for gRPC, so request-level balancing in a service-mesh data plane is a standard approach.",
